# Optional: Pushover alerts of scripts/live_smoke_test.py (`make autotest`) when a check fails.
# Copy to .env or .env.local (both ignored by git); the nightly GitHub workflow uses repository secrets instead.
# PUSHOVER_API_TOKEN=your-pushover-app-token
# PUSHOVER_USER_KEY=your-pushover-user-key
#
# The API runs as the zqsdev-api Cloudflare Worker: its vars live in api/wrangler.jsonc and its secrets
# (OPENAI_API_KEY, ADMIN_TOKEN) in Cloudflare. For `wrangler dev`, copy api/.dev.vars.example to api/.dev.vars.
